 layer = "pragmatic"
 hypothesis = `Make the site’s public entry points feel like they belong to a recurring play system instead of a loose set of lore pages. The current Wednesday cadence should be legible as a release rhythm: a visitor should understand where to start, how to seed a session, where the log lives, and how the Town Library and related routes support play rather than just describing it. The copy should stay grounded in the creator identity and the existing site voice. The aim is not to make everything fantasy-themed. It is to make the site more playable, more replayable, and easier to enter from the home page or the RPG Wednesday routes.`
